<ProjectField Name="name" Value="Seri Ritchie" />
<ProjectField Name="typeCode" Value="APT" />
<ProjectField Name="description" Value="Seri Ritchie is a freehold commercial condominium of Serviced Apartments located in one of the major towns, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.propertyguru.com.my/kuala-lumpur/ampang-hilir&quot;&gt;Ampang Hilir&lt;/a&gt;, a pleasant residential area in the embassy enclave of Kuala Lumpur that is located just a few kilometers from the KLCC enclave, which is located in &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.propertyguru.com.my/kuala-lumpur&quot;&gt;Kuala Lumpur&lt;/a&gt;, the capital city of Malaysia. The strategic wonderful location of this prestigious establishment, being located to wonderful location of Ampang Hilir, which is fortified with the residential hubs along with various modernized facilities and strong transportation system in this property area, makes this development a special establishment. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; The condominium, Seri Ritchie is located strategically in the place of Ampang Hilir, famous area for Malaysian rising residential hubs, is however, is also an up growing area in this region, a dynamic combination of urban establishments and nature along with a good number of modernized facilities available in this property area.  Besides, a handsome number of luxurious facilities available in the surrounding areas make this property an important establishment indeed. Moreover this project has been equipped with modernized security system which is a key feature of this property area. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; The Seri Ritchie is also unique for its supreme location as being connected to different parts of Kuala Lumpur. It’s positioned so nicely that makes it highly accessible to different busy and important areas through different highways and main roads like Jalan Ampang and Jalan Ampang Hilir, Jalan Lingkaran Tengah 2 which can lead to different directions like KL city centre and the major location of Malaysia as KLCC is in a short distance from this property area. Besides these, this property area is within short reach from the development, which is located just a few hundred meters away from many embassies, such as the Kenya Embassy, Korea Embassy, Royal Belgium Embassy, and Residence of The Ambassador of Ireland, which makes the transportation system more convenient for the residents. Apart from that, Rapid KL buses and city taxi services make the transportation system more dynamic and easily accessible for its residents. Moreover, this development has been surrounded by a good number of modern and luxurious amenities like petrol station, post office, exclusive restaurants, banks, fast-food outlets, schools, entertainment outlets and other shopping outlets and so on. A good number of national and international reputed educational institutes like Fairview International School, Sayfol International School are located within short driving distance from this area. Besides, Gleneagles Hospital is located within short driving distance to ensure health care related facilties. Raintree Club, Selangor Polo &amp;amp; Equestrian Club as well as the Royal Selangor Golf Club are located within short reach from this property area to ensure the recreational facilities. As KLCC is situated very nearby, ensuring world class shopping experience because of close proximity of shopping malls like Great Eastern Mall, posh restaurants and a modern park in this residential zone. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; The Seri Ritchie featured handful number standardized facilities for the residents including Barbecue area, a gymnasium, playground, sauna, swimming pool, barbeque area, covered parking and so on. Moreover, this property has been equipped with 24X7 guarded securities system which makes the property an ultra-modern secured zone to live with. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; The elegant low-rising establishment is being designed with only 3 blocks consisting of 4-storey residential units comprising a total number of only 20 units in its occupied land area. The low density living environment ensures the peace and tranquility for its residents. These residential units are being provided with the built in size of 1,800 square feet up to 3,000 square feet, which also provides wide living environment. These premium residential units are being built up with the concept of 2 bedrooms, 1 guest room and 3 bathrooms up to 3 bedrooms, 1 guest room along with 4 bathrooms concept. These lavish designed residential units are being provided with both furnished and semi-furnished facilities inside. At least 1 car parking allotment is there for the prospective residents of this establishment. The rental price ranges from RM6,500 up to RM11,000, which makes this property available and affordable to middle and high income groups in this region. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; This lavish project’s rental price ranges from RM6,500 up to RM11,000, which is a high price compared to adjacent properties like Nobleton Crest, M-Suites, Seri Ampang Hilir Residences, 202 DC (Desa Cahaya) and Madge Mansions and other related establishments. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; There are some other projects this area like &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.propertyguru.com.my/condo/m-suites-1908&quot;&gt;M-Suites&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.propertyguru.com.my/condo/nobleton-crest-7367&quot;&gt;Nobleton Crest&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.propertyguru.com.my/condo/seri-ampang-hilir-residences-5456&quot;&gt;Seri Ampang Hilir Residences&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.propertyguru.com.my/condo/mutiara-upper-east-desa-pandan-50&quot;&gt;Mutiara Upper East Desa Pandan&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.propertyguru.com.my/condo/madge-mansions-5528&quot;&gt;Madge Mansions&lt;/a&gt; which are also worth of checking." />
