<ProjectField Name="name" Value="The Clovers" />
<ProjectField Name="typeCode" Value="CONDO" />
<ProjectField Name="description" Value="&lt;h2&gt;The Clovers&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;The Clovers Penang, or The Clovers, is strategically located in Lengkok Merbah 3, Taman Sri Bayan at &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.propertyguru.com.my/penang/sungai-ara&quot;&gt;Sungai Ara, Penang.&lt;/a&gt;With a total 670 number of units, the Clovers offers amenities such as a gymnasium, swimming pool, 3-tier security, and it&amp;rsquo;s a &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.propertyguru.com.my/property-for-sale/p/freehold&quot;&gt;freehold&lt;/a&gt; development.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2&gt;Concept&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;The Clovers is a gateway to various attractive locations to visit in the city. The Great Penang War Museum is located within a 9km distance, where residents can explore the war tunnels and get a glimpse of its dark past. On the opposite side of the building, residents can visit the comforting organic farm, Audi Dream Farm and explore the scenic Balik Pulau within a distance of 22km or 20 minutes drive away. The residents can explore the picturesque view of the Air Item Dam within a short distance of 15km.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2&gt;Accessibility and Amenities near The Clovers&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;The Clovers Penang is located in the safest and convenient neighbourhood of the city. The place is surrounded by external amenities such as financial institutions, cinema, subways, bus stops, salons, eateries, etc. All major highways such as Jalan Merbah, Jalan Dato Ismail Hashim, Jalan Tun Dr Awang and Jalan Sultan Azlan Shah are located quite close to the building, offering easy access to the city.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2&gt;Facilities and Project Details&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;The Clovers Penang is a high-rise building comprised of three stylised blocks. From an aerial view, the three blocks take the shape of a clover. The names of the three blocks are Spes, Fides and Fortuna. There are eleven layouts in this building, offering a wide range of selection for the customers. The building has been built with a capacity to accommodate 892 residential units.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Type A &amp;amp; B&lt;/b&gt; covers a built-up space of 1,589 sq ft with one master bedroom, one master bathroom, two standard bedrooms, one standard bathroom, utility room, powder room, living room, dining space with shared space for kitchen, two ac yard, one dry yard, lanai and a foyer.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;Type C &amp;amp; D&lt;/b&gt; comprises an area of 1,394 sq ft and contain one master bedroom. One master bathroom, one standard bedroom, one standard bath, a porch, foyer, powder room, a dry cum wet kitchen, living room, separate dining space, two ac yard, one dry yard.&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;Type E&lt;/b&gt; units cover an area of 776 sq ft with one master bedroom, one master bathroom, one separate bedroom, one standard bathroom, kitchen, one ac yard, a foyer, an extended living room with shared space for dining purpose.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Type F&lt;/b&gt; includes an area of 1,012 sq ft and comprises of 2 bedrooms, two bathrooms, a living hall with shared space for dining and kitchen, one dry yard, one ac yard and a foyer.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Type G &lt;/b&gt;covers an area of 900 sq ft with three bedrooms, two bathrooms, dry yard, dry cum wet kitchen, a corridor, living room with shared dining space, a/c yard and a foyer.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Type H&lt;/b&gt; has a built-up area of 728 sq ft with a living room, dining space, wet cum dry kitchen space, lobby, a/c yard, one master bedroom, one separate bedroom, one bathroom and a dry yard.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Penthouse Type&lt;/strong&gt;  - While the &lt;b&gt;Type A Penthouse&lt;/b&gt; consists of 2,729 sq ft, the &lt;b&gt;Type B Penthouse&lt;/b&gt; is covering a slightly large space of 2,907 sq ft. The &lt;b&gt;Type C Penthouse&lt;/b&gt; covers an area of 2,785 sq ft, and the &lt;b&gt;Type D Penthouse&lt;/b&gt; has a built-up space of 1,875 sq ft. &lt;b&gt;The Type J Penthouse&lt;/b&gt; includes a space of 1,633 sq ft.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;br /&gt;Amenity-wise, you get an access to a multi-equipment present gymnasium room. It has best trainers to train you upon latest fitness hacks. Similarly, there is an infinity swimming pool that will give you royal bath experience in your leisure time. The condo is well protected by 3-tier security. So, unauthorised access of unwanted guests is highly impossible.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3&gt;Schools/Colleges/Education Institute&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;The area is surrounded with many schools such as SJK (T) Sungai Ara, SJK T Bayan Lepas, Penang Free School and Sekolah Menengah Kebangsaan Jelutong.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3&gt;Medical Centres&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;For regular health check-ups, residents can visit the nearest PluxHealth Clinic, Klinik Public, Klinik Medilife and many more.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3&gt;Shops/Shopping Malls&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;High-end shopping complexes such as D&amp;rsquo;Piazza Mall, Queensbay Mall, Sunshine Square and Udini Square are also located within a few minutes drive away.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3&gt;Restaurant/Eateries&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;The current top 5 restaurants nearby Quayside Penang are:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Dozo SummerSkye Square, Bayan Lepas&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Acupaday&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Gathers In&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Sushi YA Bayan Lepas&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Iqbal Tomyam&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3&gt;The Clovers Developer&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;The building is a dream project of the popular Asia Green Group Developer, known for their quality structure and international grade of developments. They are known for developing quality medium cost housing to luxury-based villas. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.propertyguru.com.my/condo/quaywest-residence-6389&quot;&gt;QuayWest Residence &lt;/a&gt;and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.propertyguru.com.my/condo/asia-heights-1853&quot;&gt;Asia Heights &lt;/a&gt;are some of the developments from the same developer.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3&gt;The Clovers Launch Details&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;The starting price of the unit comes to be RM430,000 whereas the starting rental price comes to be RM1,500. Similar projects around the same locality worth checking are&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.propertyguru.com.my/condo/acres-ville-943&quot;&gt;Acres Ville @ Sungai Ara&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.propertyguru.com.my/condo/gardens-ville-6008&quot;&gt;Gardens Ville @ Sungai Ara&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.propertyguru.com.my/condo/idaman-iris-3653&quot;&gt;Idaman Iris @ Sungai Ara&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.propertyguru.com.my/condo/idaman-lavender-2138&quot;&gt;Idaman Lavender @ Sungai Ara &lt;/a&gt;and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.propertyguru.com.my/condo/imperial-residences-sungai-ara-7934&quot;&gt;Imperial Residences @ Sungai Ara&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;" />
